  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 19th level, as an incredible stunt whenever the bravo is reduced to 0 hit points or fewer, he can spend all of his dodge pool to instead be reduced to 1 hit point as long as he has at least 5% to spend from his dodge pool. Effects that would kill the bravo outright without dealing hit point damage are not affected by this ability.</p>\n<p>Once the bravo uses this ability to save himself, he cannot do so again until 1 minute has passed.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/bravo#toc22\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
